pkg:Evidence_v1_12_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.12.0 (MINOR release -- first real Path B deliverable)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: executed STORY-1 (Now-ranked, Iteration 1's committed work) for real. Built 04-interactive-page/01-corpus-contract/corpus_contract_v1_0_0.json against the template's real schema, from real extracted content: 7 CATEGORIES and 18 PRINCIPLES from Stage 2's actual taxonomy (each PRINCIPLE carrying its full real Stage 3 prose), 15 CITATIONS from Stage 1's actual Publications, 2 FRAMEWORKS the report's own text actually invokes (Theory of Constraints, Jevons Paradox), 7 RELATIONS built from genuine cross-references found by searching the document text itself, not invented. One real error found and fixed during the build (a broken 'reinforces' reference to a non-existent id), caught by a structural validation pass run before marking anything complete. Confirmed directly, not assumed, that the 2 disclosed evidentiary limitations STORY-1 was rescoped to own (Amplitude figures, GitLab COI) are present verbatim in the actual PRINCIPLES prose, across 5 sections. Marked TASK-1 and STORY-1 Done with every L2 requirement satisfied as SHACL found it missing, not pre-empted: real Evidence (evidenceVerified true, honest verification-method description), a genuine observable-behaviour AcceptanceCriterion in Gherkin form, and hasExecutionModality checked precisely against the vocabulary's own distinction -- Mode_Automated, since Mode_Hybrid specifically requires a person to have materially changed the agent's output, which did not happen. Re-verified: pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "2027f19ae15e302a679f21aa67f7357f7a1b91ee2ddd385b993cc83c36207e94"^^xsd:string .
